# BRZI PREGLED - Delegati in Eventi

## 🎯 Kaj So Delegati?

**Delegat** = referenca na metodo z določenim podpisom

```csharp
// Definiram tip delegata
public delegate void ItemPlayedEventHandler(string title, int count);

// Ustvarim instance delegata (različne metode)
ItemPlayedEventHandler handler1 = Console.WriteLine;  // ❌ Ne ujema signature
ItemPlayedEventHandler handler2 = (t, c) => Console.WriteLine($"{t}: {c}");  // ✅ OK - Lambda
```

---

## 🔔 Kaj So Eventi?

**Event** = mehanizem za obvestilo med objekti

```csharp
// Definiram event
public event ItemPlayedEventHandler ItemPlayed;

// Naročim se na event
player.ItemPlayed += MyHandler;

// Se odznačim
player.ItemPlayed -= MyHandler;

// Sproži event
OnItemPlayed("Pesem", 5);
```

