## 🎛️ Naročanje na Eventi

```csharp
// Naročim se (Subscribe)
event += handler;

// Odnaročim se (Unsubscribe)
event -= handler;

// Primer v konstruktorju Form1
public Form1()
{
    playlist.PlaylistChanged += playlist_PlaylistChanged;
    stats.ItemPlayed += stats_ItemPlayed;
}
```

