## 📝 Kaj je potrebno dodati v Kodo?

### 1. Definiraj Delegate
```csharp
public delegate void MyDelegate(string msg);
```

### 2. Definiraj Event
```csharp
public event MyDelegate MyEvent;
```

### 3. Spro­ži Event
```csharp
protected void OnMyEvent(string msg)
{
    MyEvent?.Invoke(msg);
}
```

### 4. Ustvari Handler
```csharp
private void MyHandler(string msg)
{
    // Kaj storiti ob eventu
}
```

### 5. Naroči se na Event
```csharp
obj.MyEvent += MyHandler;
```

